From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:02:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] presentation: share panorama policy across library browse and
 related grids

Use a common host, shape-aware placeholders and bounded thumbnail prefetch. Unknown wide covers no longer span two of three provisional book columns. Sample a bounded number of known covers and defer first shape commits while scrolling. Preserve paging snapshot invalidation and all selection/navigation callbacks. Related grids are Anikku-specific; Mihon has separate later placeholder/preload patches, so do not transplant the implementation blindly.
